  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 695156270}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2a091af31331bb74880c829bb675da80, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StorySequence
  mode: 1
  cameraPath:
  - {fileID: 1674173387}
  - {fileID: 864488923}
  - {fileID: 1072718900}
  - {fileID: 1984973739}
  secondsPerShot: 6
  lines:
  - With a final cry, Malgrath fell - and the curse he had fed for centuries died with him.
  - The stones began to fall. Every trapped soul rose toward the light.
  - And for the first time in a thousand years, someone walked out of the King's dungeon alive.
  credits: 'DUNGEON ESCAPE

    Curse of the Forgotten King



    GAME DESIGN, LEVELS & STORY

    Peash Salek


    PROGRAMMING

    Peash Salek

    with AI assistance from Claude (Anthropic)


    ENGINE

    Unity 6 (Universal Render Pipeline)


    CHARACTERS

    Knight: Mixamo (Adobe)

    Enemy and boss models: Sketchfab artists (CC BY) - see CREDITS.md


    ANIMATIONS

    Universal Animation Library 1 & 2 by Quaternius (CC0)


    TEXTURES

    Poly Haven (CC0)


    SOUND EFFECTS

    RPG Sound Pack by artisticdude (CC0)

    Sword sounds by StarNinjas (CC0)


    MUSIC

    Dungeon Ambience by yd (CC0)

    Dark Cavern Ambient by Paul Wortmann (CC0)

    Heavy Dungeon by MintoDog (CC0)



    Made for the LUT University Game Development Project



    Thank you for playing!'
